# mm.json test target

Exercises both layers on the host: the scanner's grammar cases with their
offsets and token sequences, the decoder and the numeric helpers, the value
model with parse and write in both layouts, the unchanged-output rule on every
failure path, and the JSON Parsing Test Suite corpus under fixtures/, whose
y_ exceptions and i_ outcomes are tabulated in corpus.cpp.
